---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import PageHero from "../../components/PageHero.astro";
import CtaBand from "../../components/CtaBand.astro";
import { SITE } from "../../site";

const faqs = [
  [
    "What does Bin Othaimeen Group do?",
    "Bin Othaimeen Group specializes in providing top-tier business advisory, trading, and marketing services to clients interested in doing business within the GCC. We assist clients in navigating and excelling within the dynamic GCC market landscape.",
  ],
  [
    "What industries do you specialize in?",
    "Bin Othaimeen Group has expertise in diverse sectors including Hospitality & Entertainment, Food & Beverage, Sports & Wellness, Art & Culture, and Digital Services within the GCC region.",
  ],
  [
    "What are the benefits of working with Bin Othaimeen Group?",
    "Employees enjoy a dynamic work environment, growth opportunities, exposure to regional projects, and a collaborative team culture centered around excellence and innovation.",
  ],
];
---

<Base
  title="Careers"
  description="Build your career at Bin Othaimeen Group in Riyadh: regional projects, professional growth and a collaborative culture centred on excellence and innovation."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Careers"
    title="A world of <em>limitless possibilities.</em>"
    lede="Embarking on a career with Bin Othaimeen Group means stepping into a world of unparalleled growth and professional fulfillment."
    image="/images/photo/riyadh-aerial-600.webp"
    imageAlt="Aerial view of the Riyadh skyline"
    crumbs={[{ label: "About", href: "/company-overview/" }, { label: "Careers" }]}
  />

  <section class="section paper on-light">
    <div class="wrap grid-2">
      <div class="prose" data-reveal>
        <p>
          At the very heart of our success lies a deep-seated commitment to nurturing talent, fostering innovation, and rewarding
          excellence. As part of our team, you wouldn't just be taking up a job, but rather embracing a journey of self-discovery,
          skill enhancement, and legacy-building. Our diverse array of services, coupled with a robust presence in the GCC region,
          provides a unique vantage point to witness and influence the dynamic interplay of culture, business, and innovation.
        </p>
        <p>
          Each day at Bin Othaimeen brings fresh challenges, new learning opportunities, and the exhilarating thrill of shaping the
          future. Our ethos is built on collaboration, continual learning, and a steadfast dedication to achieving greatness. Joining us
          means becoming part of a family that celebrates each achievement, supports every endeavor, and dreams boundlessly. For the
          ambitious, the passionate, and the visionary, there's no place quite like Bin Othaimeen Group to truly realize one's potential.
        </p>
        <h2>Benefits and rewards</h2>
        <p>
          Joining the Bin Othaimeen Group means more than just securing a job: it's an invitation to shape your future amidst a company
          that highly values its employees. Our team members are the backbone of our success, and in recognition of this, we offer
          generous remuneration packages that stand out in the industry. Beyond the attractive salary, employees are entitled to
          substantial annual leave, allowing a well-deserved rest and rejuvenation.
        </p>
        <p>
          What truly sets us apart is the invigorating and positive work culture that we cultivate: a space where innovation thrives,
          ideas are celebrated, and every individual's contribution is recognized. We provide boundless opportunities for professional
          growth, continual education, and the chance to network across a spectrum of industries.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div data-reveal style="--d:1">
        <div class="faq">
          {
            faqs.map(([q, a], i) => (
              <details open={i === 0}>
                <summary>{q}</summary>
                <p>{a}</p>
              </details>
            ))
          }
        </div>
        <div class="open dark">
          <p class="eyebrow">Open positions</p>
          <h2 class="h-md">There are no advertised vacancies right now.</h2>
          <p>
            We are always glad to hear from talented people. Send your CV and a short note about the role you are looking for to our
            recruiting team.
          </p>
          <a class="btn" href={`mailto:${SITE.recruiting}?subject=Career%20enquiry`}>{SITE.recruiting}</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand />
</Base>

<style>
  .prose h2 {
    color: var(--indigo);
  }
  .faq {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }
  details {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 22px 36px 22px 0;
    position: relative;
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--indigo);
  }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }
  summary::after {
    content: "+";
    position: absolute;
    right: 4px;
    top: 20px;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--gold-deep);
  }
  details[open] summary::after {
    content: "−";
  }
  details p {
    color: var(--muted);
    padding-right: 24px;
  }
  .open {
    padding: 34px 32px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }
  .open p:not(.eyebrow) {
    color: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.78);
  }
  .open .btn {
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
</style>
